 "remarks": "Welcome to 80 County! This bright, move-in-ready 1-bedroom, 1-bath condo in Norwalk offers comfort, style, and convenience. The spacious open-concept living and dining area features hardwood floors, recessed lighting, and abundant natural light. The bright, refurbished kitchen with plenty cabinet space.  The generously sized bedroom includes hardwood floors, a spacious walk-in closet, and fresh paint. Additional highlights include an updated bathroom, updated wall A/C units, an updated electrical panel, and IN-UNIT LAUNDRY  Enjoy your private balcony overlooking the expansive courtyard, along with community amenities including an in-ground pool and clubhouse. Conveniently located minutes from shopping, restaurants, beaches, public transportation, entertainment, and major highways.  Perfect for first-time homebuyers, those looking to downsize, or anyone seeking comfortable, low-maintenance living in Norwalk! The sale is contingent upon the seller finding suitable housing.",
